  never touches either `_project-context.md` or this `.example` template —
  the underscore-prefix exclusion in `planSync()` + the `ALLOWED_DEST` regex
  in `applyAction()` guarantee it.

  Keep content terse and load-bearing. Generic advice dilutes the rubric.
-->

